<title>USA: Electronic Designs Q2 net falls.</title>
<headline>Electronic Designs Q2 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>WESTBOROUGH, Mass. 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Amounts in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>				 Three months ended  Six months ended</p>
<p>			    Mar 30,   Mar 31,    Mar 30,    Mar 31,</p>
<p>				1997	 1996	 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Revenues		 $ 9,925  $ 15,564   $ 20,946   $ 29,194</p>
<p> Net income		 1,067     1,157	2,338	  236</p>
<p> Net income per share    0.13	0.14	 0.27	 0.07</p>
